<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/node_property> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                               rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/NamedThing> ;
                                               rdfs:label "node property" ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A grouping for any property that holds between a node and a value" ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .


###  https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/phenotype_of
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/phenotype_of> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
