                                                                       )
                                                         ] ;
                                              rdfs:label "phenotype of" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .


###  https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/published_in
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/published_in> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
