                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://example.org/mvikg/linkml> ;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "We recommend any biome class from the GOLD ontology" .


###  http://example.org/mvikg/DevelopmentalStage
