                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Represents a specific point or period in an organism's life cycle" ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://example.org/mvikg/DevelopmentalStage> ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://example.org/mvikg/linkml> ;
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A developmental stage is a stage corresponding to a stage in bacteria's growth. e.g.: exponential, lag." .


