                                            <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/so#SOFA> ;
                                            rdfs:comment "A sequence_feature with an extent greater than zero. A nucleotide region is composed of bases and a polypeptide region is composed of amino acids." ;
